{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311050","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1231105001:1":{"text":"러스트 항은 전 세계 특산품이 모이는 무역의 중심지에요!","source_cn":"锈锚港一直以来都是海运枢纽，各地的特色物产都会在这里交汇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB123943252A89F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231105002:1":{"text":"와일더스 연맹의 꽃차나 아센 사막의 모피, 금빛이삭 마을의 밀... 심지어는 수도의 보석 반지까지도요!","source_cn":"绿裔联盟的花茶，荒角沙漠的皮毛，金穗村的麦货……我甚至...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64AA16AD47FB5C94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231105003:1":{"text":"하지만 러스트 항이 봉쇄되어서 이런 물건들을 들여올 수 없게 되었어요.","source_cn":"可如今锈锚港封锁，这些货物无法运入。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA259635F2E88EFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1231105004:1":{"text":"자연의 풀과 나무 향기가 가득했던 꽃차가 그립네요. 정말 아쉬워요...","source_cn":"我很想念花茶，有一股自然的草木清香。可惜呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FAA245785CFAB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人梅妮吉":{"text":"상인 메기니","source":"商人梅妮吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:居民葛朗特":{"text":"그랑트","source":"居民葛朗特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}